  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kyoto Protocol Contribution 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pr&#xed;spevok Kj&#xf3;tsky protokol 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Contribution of the Slovak Republic to UNFCCC Kyoto Protocol for 2021. The main aim of the Protocol is the protection of the environment against the negative impacts of the climate change through the reduction of greenhouse gas emission.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Pr&#xed;spevok SR pre Kj&#xf3;tsky protokol k UNFCCC za rok 2021.&#xa0;Hlavn&#xfd;m zameran&#xed;m protokolu je ochrana &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho prostredia pred negat&#xed;vnymi vplyvmi zmeny kl&#xed;my prostredn&#xed;ctvom zni&#x17e;ovania emisi&#xed; sklen&#xed;kov&#xfd;ch plynov.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Financovanie opatren&#xed; zameran&#xfd;ch na zn&#xed;&#x17e;enie emisi&#xed;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
